<title>USA: Getchell Gold offers one mln shares at $50.</title>
<headline>Getchell Gold offers one mln shares at $50.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Getchell Gold Corp said Wednesday it had commenced a public offering of one million shares at $50 each.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to provide funds for the continued development of the Turquoise Ridge Mine, for exploration on the Getchell property, and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Getchell is a gold mining and exploration company with operations in north-central Nevada.</p>
